@startuml
title Simulation Battle of Grunwald - State Machine Diagram

skinparam linetype ortho

[*] --> ApplicationStarted

state ApplicationStarted {
  [*] --> WindowInitialized
  WindowInitialized : MainWindow()
  WindowInitialized : create panels
  WindowInitialized : connect Qt signals
}

ApplicationStarted --> WaitingForConfig : GUI visible

WaitingForConfig : configPath points to default directory
WaitingForConfig --> ConfigSelected : Load clicked\nloadConfig()
WaitingForConfig --> ReportSelection : Start clicked\nconfigPath not empty
WaitingForConfig --> WaitingForConfig : Start clicked\nconfigPath empty / warning
WaitingForConfig --> [*] : Exit clicked

ConfigSelected : CSV file selected
ConfigSelected --> WaitingForConfig : QMessageBox information

ReportSelection : startBattle()
ReportSelection : LoadFromFile(configPath)
ReportSelection --> WaitingForConfig : save report dialog canceled
ReportSelection --> CampaignInitialized : report path selected\nCSV header written

CampaignInitialized : currentBattleIndex = 0
CampaignInitialized : hussarsWins = 0
CampaignInitialized : teutonicWins = 0
CampaignInitialized --> PreparingBattle : startNextBattle()

state CampaignRunning {
  [*] --> PreparingBattle

  PreparingBattle --> CampaignFinished : currentBattleIndex >= loadedConfig.size() - 1
  PreparingBattle --> BattleSkipped : invalid FractionConfig\nor Army constructor throws
  PreparingBattle --> BattleReady : create Hussars Army\ncreate Teutonic Army\ncreate Battle

  BattleSkipped : BattleReport::save_skipped()
  BattleSkipped : HistoryPanel::addBattleResult()
  BattleSkipped --> PreparingBattle : currentBattleIndex += 2

  BattleReady : BattlePanel::setBattleNumber()
  BattleReady : Battle::attach(battlePanel)
  BattleReady --> BattleRunning : battleTimer.start()

  state BattleRunning {
    [*] --> WaitingForTick

    WaitingForTick --> ExecutingRound : QTimer::timeout\nbattleStep()

    ExecutingRound : Battle::do_Round()
    ExecutingRound : pick random alive warriors
    ExecutingRound : choose attacker
    ExecutingRound --> ApplyingCombat

    ApplyingCombat : warrior attacks enemy
    ApplyingCombat : possible counterattack
    ApplyingCombat : update damage, kills, morale
    ApplyingCombat --> RandomEventCheck : round > 20\nand eventsTriggered < maxEvents
    ApplyingCombat --> NotifyingObservers : otherwise

    RandomEventCheck --> ApplyingRandomEvent : 3% chance succeeds
    RandomEventCheck --> NotifyingObservers : chance fails

    ApplyingRandomEvent : RandomEvent::apply(targetArmy)
    ApplyingRandomEvent : currentEvent = event name
    ApplyingRandomEvent --> NotifyingObservers

    NotifyingObservers : Battle::notify()
    NotifyingObservers : BattlePanel::update()
    NotifyingObservers --> UpdatingGui

    UpdatingGui : update alive counts
    UpdatingGui : update damage and kills
    UpdatingGui : update probability and current winner
    UpdatingGui --> BattleFinished : Battle::is_finished() == true
    UpdatingGui --> WaitingForTick : Battle::is_finished() == false
  }

  BattleFinished : battleTimer.stop()
  BattleFinished : Battle::finishBattle()
  BattleFinished : HistoryPanel::addBattleResult()
  BattleFinished : BattleReport::save()
  BattleFinished --> PreparingBattle : update wins\ncurrentBattleIndex += 2\ndelete currentBattle

  CampaignFinished : show campaign summary
  CampaignFinished --> WaitingForConfig : user may start/load again
}

PreparingBattle --> CampaignRunning.PreparingBattle
CampaignRunning.CampaignFinished --> WaitingForConfig

WaitingForConfig --> SpeedChanged : speed changed
BattleRunning --> SpeedChanged : speed changed
SpeedChanged : changeSpeed()
SpeedChanged : battleTimer interval = 500 / 200 / 50
SpeedChanged --> WaitingForConfig : no active battle
SpeedChanged --> BattleRunning : active battle

@enduml
